OL,3,GNEWSATrams suspended as fire breaks out
OL,4,Aat derelict pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrams have been suspended in an area of
OL,7,FNottingham after a fire started at a
OL,8,Fderelict pub.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it had sent four engines and an
OL,12,Faerial ladder platform to the blaze at
OL,13,FThe Cricket Players pub in Radford
OL,14,FRoad, in the Hyson Green area of the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FNET, which operates Nottingham's trams,
OL,18,Fsaid there were currently no services
OL,19,Fin either direction between Wilkinson
OL,20,FStreet and The Forest due to the
OL,21,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
